{"updated":"2026-11-15T17:36+00:00","warnings":[{"event":"Yellow ice warning","level":"yellow","headline":"Icy stretches developing tonight likely to lead to some difficult driving conditions.","description":"An area of rain and hill snow (snow mainly above 200 m but not expected to be impactful) will clear to the southeast tonight with skies then at least partially clearing. This will result in temperatures falling below freezing and some icy stretches developing on untreated surfaces. This is likely to lead to difficult driving conditions. These conditions will probably not develop across northern England and southeast Scotland until the end of the night. Across northern Scotland, icy conditions are likely to be exacerbated by some wintry showers, with snow falling to low levels for a time before becoming mainly confined to higher ground late in the night. No more than 1-2 cm is likely at lower levels, with higher ground perhaps seeing up to 4 or 5 cm from these wintry showers.","impacts":["Some injuries from slips and falls on icy surfaces","Probably some icy patches on some untreated roads, pavements and cycle paths"],"onset":"2026-11-15T18:00:00+00:00","expires":"2026-11-16T10:00:00+00:00","areas":[{"name":"Central, Tayside & Fife | Grampian | Highlands & Eilean Siar | North East England | North West England | Strathclyde | SW Scotland, Lothian Borders","polygons":[[[58.557,-3.134],[58.567,-3.169],[58.572,-3.213],[58.575,-3.265],[58.574,-3.325],[58.571,-3.389],[58.565,-3.459],[58.559,-3.533],[58.551,-3.609],[58.543,-3.686],[58.535,-3.763],[58.527,-3.839],[58.521,-3.914],[58.516,-3.985],[58.513,-4.051],[58.512,-4.113],[58.513,-4.176],[58.514,-4.24],[58.517,-4.304],[58.52,-4.369],[58.524,-4.434],[58.526,-4.497],[58.529,-4.559],[58.53,-4.62],[58.529,-4.679],[58.527,-4.734],[58.522,-4.787],[58.515,-4.837],[58.505,-4.882],[58.493,-4.918],[58.48,-4.951],[58.465,-4.982],[58.448,-5.01],[58.43,-5.036],[58.411,-5.061],[58.391,-5.085],[58.37,-5.107],[58.349,-5.129],[58.32